{"request_id": "ec5eb648-08f8-4822-84bf-9b1886183ce2", "created_at": "2026-05-18T15:13:30+08:00", "query": "子女成年仍在學，能當眷屬？", "top_k": 3, "answer": "精簡答案：\n子女成年後仍在學，一般不能繼續當眷屬，但如果是應屆畢業未滿一年，則仍可以眷屬身分參加健保。\n\n補充重點：\n1. 成人且無職業的二親等內直系血親卑親屬，若是應屆畢業未滿一年，可以當眷屬參加全民健康保險。\n2. 同樣條件也適用於服兵役退伍未滿一年的情況。\n3. 一般成年子女若未符合上述條件，無法以眷屬身分參加健保。", "route_mode": "vector", "route_reason": "default to vector retrieval", "route_confidence": 0.55, "retrieved_chunks": [{"rank": 1, "doc_id": "other_031", "source": "other", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3553-961e9-3249-1.html", "question": "第五類低收入戶成員包括那些？", "chunk_type": "single", "length_type": "short", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 1, "distance": 0.5992760062217712}, {"rank": 2, "doc_id": "card_012", "source": "health insurance card", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/dl-11732-1c5cab2b76884db9927e8726dff2b483-1.pdf", "question": "適格申請人之定義？(未成年人辦理補發身分證、受託人)", "chunk_type": "single", "length_type": "short", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 1, "distance": 0.6123039722442627}, {"rank": 3, "doc_id": "other_013", "source": "other", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3631-6abe1-3249-1.html", "question": "保險對象有那些身分限制？", "chunk_type": "long_split", "length_type": "long", "chunk_index": 3, "chunk_total": 3, "distance": 0.6300421357154846}], "table_matches": [{"rank": 1, "table_id": "student_foreign_premium", "title": "在學僑生、外籍生應繳納多少保險費，如何繳納", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3791-61e1b-3246-1.html", "source": "nhi", "score": 2.5, "matched_rows": [], "matched_fields": [], "general_rules": {}}, {"rank": 2, "table_id": "premium_ratio", "title": "各類保險對象保險費的負擔比率", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3783-12823-3246-1.html", "source": "nhi", "score": 2.2, "matched_rows": [{"category": "第一類", "type_name": "公務人員、公職人員", "scope": "本人及眷屬", "insured_percent": 30, "employer_percent": 70, "government_percent": 0}, {"category": "第一類", "type_name": "私校教職員", "scope": "本人及眷屬", "insured_percent": 30, "employer_percent": 35, "government_percent": 35}, {"category": "第