{"request_id": "b5bb3da2-9018-4617-8589-2abd32a04ad0", "created_at": "2026-05-18T20:16:07+08:00", "query": "我離職後公司大概甚麼時候會辦轉出？", "top_k": 3, "answer": "精簡答案：\n離職後，健保轉出作業通常由勞雇雙方或公司辦理，但資料中未明確指出具體時間。\n\n補充重點：\n1. 資料中提及「多憑證網路承保作業」中轉出須確認後續投保銜接，避免中斷。\n2. 眷屬追溯轉出超過兩個月時須附相關證明以確保資料正確。\n3. 轉出作業重點在於保障被保險人健保權益，但無提供具體辦理時間。", "route_mode": "vector", "route_reason": "default to vector retrieval", "route_confidence": 0.55, "retrieved_chunks": [{"rank": 1, "doc_id": "other_036", "source": "other", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-19773-493ce-3249-1.html", "question": "「多憑證網路承保作業」申辦轉出作業注意事項", "chunk_type": "single", "length_type": "single", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 1, "distance": 0.5429458618164062}, {"rank": 2, "doc_id": "referral_004", "source": "referral", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/dl-55906-278da61690414bd4a16b83299ff438b7-1.pdf", "question": "轉診注意事項:轉出院所", "chunk_type": "single", "length_type": "single", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 1, "distance": 0.6205424070358276}, {"rank": 3, "doc_id": "referral_005", "source": "referral", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/dl-55907-edf3d853b6bd40f5b6a3e944f40294df-1.pdf", "question": "轉診注意事項:接受轉診院所", "chunk_type": "single", "length_type": "single", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 1, "distance": 0.6509243249893188}], "table_matches": [], "references": [{"rank": 1, "title": "「多憑證網路承保作業」申辦轉出作業注意事項", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-19773-493ce-3249-1.html", "source": "vector"}, {"rank": 2, "title": "轉診注意事項:轉出院所", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/dl-55906-278da61690414bd4a16b83299ff438b7-1.pdf", "source": "vector"}, {"rank": 3, "title": "轉診注意事項:接受轉診院所", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/dl-55907-edf3d853b6bd40f5b6a3e944f40294df-1.pdf", "source": "vector"}], "latency_ms": 12607, "status": "success", "error": null, "user_feedback": null, "user_feedback_at": null, "human_rating": null, "human_note": null}
{"request_id": "82c51f6e-1ab2-4e91-863d-b2f38f1df479", "created_at": "2026-05-18T20:19:01+08:00", "query": "如何更改個人通訊地址？", "top_k": 3, "answer": "精簡答案：\n個人通訊地址如需更改，健保署跨機關通報後無法修改；建議直接聯繫健保署各分區業務組查詢相關處理方式。\n\n補充重點：\n1. 健保卡指定郵寄地址一旦跨機關通報後，健保署即接收並處理資料，無法提供修改功能。\n2. 若未收到郵寄的健保卡，可洽詢健保署各分區業務組確認。\n3. 網路服務註冊的聯絡電話、電子郵件可在健保卡網路服務註冊網站內進行變更，但地址資料修改未提及。", "route_mode": "vector", "route_reason": "explanatory query pattern", "route_confidence": 0.75, "retrieved_chunks": [{"rank": 1, "doc_id": "healthbank_003", "source": "healthbank", "url": "https://myhealthbank.nhi.gov.tw/IHKE3000/IHKE3115S03", "question": "想更改健保卡網路服務註冊之密碼、電話或E-mail該如何操作？", "chunk_type": "single", "length_type": "single", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 1, "distance": 0.4181485176086426}, {"rank": 2, "doc_id": "card_005", "source": "health insurance card", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/dl-11732-1c5cab2b76884db9927e8726dff2b483-1.pdf", "question": "跨機關通報後可否修改健保卡指定郵寄地址或勾選資料？", "chunk_type": "single", "length_type": "single", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 1, "distance": 0.5331364870071411}, {"rank": 3, "doc_id": "healthbank_002", "source": "healthbank", "url": "https://myhealthbank.nhi.gov.tw/IHKE3000/IHKE3115S03", "question": "忘記密碼該怎麼辦？", "chunk_type": "single", "length_type": "single", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 1, "distance": 0.576793909072876}], "table_matches": [{"rank": 1, "table_id": "student_foreign_premium", "title": "在學僑生、外籍生應繳納多少保險費，如何繳納", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3791-61e1b-3246-1.html", "source": "nhi", "score": 3.5, "matched_rows": [], "matched_fields": [], "general_rules": {}}], "references": [{"rank": 1, "title": "想更改健保卡網路服務註冊之密碼、電話或E-mail該如何操作？", "url": "https://myhealthbank.nhi.gov.tw/IHKE3000/IHKE3115S03", "source": "vector"}, {"rank": 2, "title": "跨機關通報後可否修改健保卡指定郵寄地址或勾選資料？", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/dl-11732-1c5cab2b76884db9927e8726dff2b483-1.pdf", "source": "vector"}, {"rank": 3, "title": "忘記密碼該怎麼辦？", "url": "https://myhealthbank.nhi.gov.tw/IHKE3000/IHKE3115S03", "source": "vector"}], "latency_ms": 90174, "status": "success", "error": null, "user_feedback": null, "user_feedback_at": null, "human_rating": null, "human_note": null}
{"request_id": "a6415b40-28e5-490c-bee1-366b3d9b439c", "created_at": "2026-05-18T20:20:17+08:00", "query": "如何更改個人通訊地址？", "top_k": 3, "answer": "精簡答案：若要更改健保卡網路服務註冊的通訊電話或E-mail，可先用原設定密碼登入服務網站，選擇「帳號資料異動」進行修改。若要更改健保卡指定郵寄地址，跨機關通報後則無法修改。\n\n補充重點：\n1. 更改網路服務註冊的電話或E-mail需先登入「健保卡網路服務註冊」網站。\n2. 健保卡郵寄地址在跨機關通報後不可再做資料修正。\n3. 健保卡寄送採掛號方式，若未收到可聯繫健保署各分區業務組查詢。", "route_mode": "vector", "route_reason": "explanatory query pattern", "route_confidence": 0.75, "retrieved_chunks": [{"rank": 1, "doc_id": "healthbank_003", "source": "healthbank", "url": "https://myhealthbank.nhi.gov.tw/IHKE3000/IHKE3115S03", "question": "想更改健保卡網路服務註冊之密碼、電話或E-mail該如何操作？", "chunk_type": "single", "length_type": "single", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 1, "distance": 0.4181485176086426}, {"rank": 2, "doc_id": "card_005", "source": "health insurance card", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/dl-11732-1c5cab2b76884db9927e8726dff2b483-1.pdf", "question": "跨機關通報後可否修改健保卡指定郵寄地址或勾選資料？", "chunk_type": "single", "length_type": "single", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 1, "distance": 0.5331364870071411}, {"rank": 3, "doc_id": "healthbank_002", "source": "healthbank", "url": "https://myhealthbank.nhi.gov.tw/IHKE3000/IHKE3115S03", "question": "忘記密碼該怎麼辦？", "chunk_type": "single", "length_type": "single", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 1, "distance": 0.576793909072876}], "table_matches": [{"rank": 1, "table_id": "student_foreign_premium", "title": "在學僑生、外籍生應繳納多少保險費，如何繳納", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3791-61e1b-3246-1.html", "source": "nhi", "score": 3.5, "matched_rows": [], "matched_fields": [], "general_rules": {}}], "references": [{"rank": 1, "title": "想更改健保卡網路服務註冊之密碼、電話或E-mail該如何操作？", "url": "https://myhealthbank.nhi.gov.tw/IHKE3000/IHKE3115S03", "source": "vector"}, {"rank": 2, "title": "跨機關通報後可否修改健保卡指定郵寄地址或勾選資料？", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/dl-11732-1c5cab2b76884db9927e8726dff2b483-1.pdf", "source": "vector"}, {"rank": 3, "title": "忘記密碼該怎麼辦？", "url": "https://myhealthbank.nhi.gov.tw/IHKE3000/IHKE3115S03", "source": "vector"}], "latency_ms": 6035, "status": "success", "error": null, "user_feedback": null, "user_feedback_at": null, "human_rating": null, "human_note": null}
{"request_id": "345d09af-a66a-4e3f-9c79-7f4dd1ddc4a2", "created_at": "2026-05-18T20:23:51+08:00", "query": "如果我沒有收到帳單要如何繳費？", "top_k": 3, "answer": "精簡答案：  \n如果沒有收到健保費繳款單，可以利用健保行動快易通APP查詢或至投保地公所、健保署各分區業務組查詢，再選擇便利的方式繳納。\n\n補充重點：  \n1. 健保署每月寄發的繳款單含掃描條碼及聯絡電話，繳費需持繳款單至銀行或郵局，並無私帳收費。  \n2. 可使用自動櫃員機、網路ATM、便利超商等多元繳費方式繳納健保費。  \n3. 如有疑問，鼓勵先致電健保署或各分區業務組確認，亦可撥打0800-030-598免費專線。", "route_mode": "vector", "route_reason": "explanatory query pattern", "route_confidence": 0.75, "retrieved_chunks": [{"rank": 1, "doc_id": "insurance_008", "source": "insurance", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3794-a3f84-3246-1.html", "question": "曾有民眾收到以「全民健康保健中心」名義，寄發「健保滯納金催繳通知單」", "chunk_type": "single", "length_type": "single", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 1, "distance": 0.47714877128601074}, {"rank": 2, "doc_id": "taxe_001", "source": "taxe", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3716-5c684-3245-1.html", "question": "要報稅了！如何查詢健保費繳費金額？", "chunk_type": "long_split", "length_type": "long", "chunk_index": 2, "chunk_total": 2, "distance": 0.5064642429351807}, {"rank": 3, "doc_id": "insurance_005", "source": "insurance", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3787-5fa86-3246-1.html", "question": "保險費應如何繳交？", "chunk_type": "long_split", "length_type": "long", "chunk_index": 3, "chunk_total": 3, "distance": 0.5470950603485107}], "table_matches": [{"rank": 1, "table_id": "student_foreign_premium", "title": "在學僑生、外籍生應繳納多少保險費，如何繳納", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3791-61e1b-3246-1.html", "source": "nhi", "score": 5.0, "matched_rows": [], "matched_fields": [], "general_rules": {}}], "references": [{"rank": 1, "title": "曾有民眾收到以「全民健康保健中心」名義，寄發「健保滯納金催繳通知單」", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3794-a3f84-3246-1.html", "source": "vector"}, {"rank": 2, "title": "要報稅了！如何查詢健保費繳費金額？", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3716-5c684-3245-1.html", "source": "vector"}, {"rank": 3, "title": "保險費應如何繳交？", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3787-5fa86-3246-1.html", "source": "vector"}], "latency_ms": 10852, "s