{"request_id": "9c3fe6c5-a80d-40d2-9035-faa56defa93c", "created_at": "2026-05-18T20:28:34+08:00", "query": "低收入戶健保費有減免嗎?", "top_k": 3, "answer": "精簡答案：  \n低收入戶的健保費由政府全額負擔，不需自行繳納。  \n\n補充重點：  \n1. 低收入戶屬「第五類」保險對象，本人負擔比例為0%，政府負擔100%。  \n2. 各級政府辦理保險對象健保費補助，且多數補助資格自動核定，不需向健保署提出申請。  \n3. 根據社會救助法規定，合於低收入戶資格者皆可以第五類身份參加全民健康保險。", "route_mode": "table", "route_reason": "table cue keyword with matched table rows", "route_confidence": 0.92, "retrieved_chunks": [{"rank": 1, "doc_id": "insurance_007", "source": "insurance", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3793-e8fe7-3246-1.html", "question": "無力繳納健保費者，有那些協助措施？", "chunk_type": "single", "length_type": "medium", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 1, "distance": 0.39589130878448486}, {"rank": 2, "doc_id": "taxe_001", "source": "taxe", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3716-5c684-3245-1.html", "question": "要報稅了！如何查詢健保費繳費金額？", "chunk_type": "long_split", "length_type": "long", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 2, "distance": 0.4855579137802124}, {"rank": 3, "doc_id": "other_013", "source": "other", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3631-6abe1-3249-1.html", "question": "保險對象有那些身分限制？", "chunk_type": "long_split", "length_type": "long", "chunk_index": 3, "chunk_total": 3, "distance": 0.4909172058105469}], "table_matches": [{"rank": 1, "table_id": "premium_ratio", "title": "各類保險對象保險費的負擔比率", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3783-12823-3246-1.html", "source": "nhi", "score": 7.6, "matched_rows": [{"category": "第五類", "type_name": "低收入戶", "scope": "本人", "insured_percent": 0, "employer_percent": 0, "government_percent": 100}], "matched_fields": [], "general_rules": {}}, {"rank": 2, "table_id": "premium_subsidy", "title": "各級政府辦理保險對象健保費補助項目一覽表", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3789-62c16-3246-1.html", "source": "nhi", "score": 6.0, "matched_rows": [], "matched_fields": [], "general_rules": {"auto_apply": ["左列多數補助資格，保險對象不需向健保署提出申請。", "由各補助單位按月提供符合補助名單，於健保費開計作業中直接扣減補助。", "如應受補助而未獲補助，可能因身分資料變更或補助名單延遲送達，可向補助單位、各縣市政府社政單位、健保署或投保單位洽詢。"