{"request_id": "252d0432-046a-4a6e-857b-7c82f01d9852", "created_at": "2026-05-18T20:43:04+08:00", "query": "忘了繳保險費會怎樣?", "top_k": 3, "answer": "精簡答案：忘記繳納健保保險費會被加徵滯納金，且若逾期太久，健保署可能會移送行政執行。\n\n補充重點：\n1. 超過寬限期未繳納者，每逾一日需加徵應納費額0.1%的滯納金，滯納金上限為應納費額的5%。\n2. 投保單位或扣費義務人加徵滯納金的上限為應納費額的15%。\n3. 若超過繳費期限30日未繳，或被保險人超過150日未繳，健保署可移送行政執行。", "route_mode": "vector", "route_reason": "default to vector retrieval", "route_confidence": 0.55, "retrieved_chunks": [{"rank": 1, "doc_id": "insurance_005", "source": "insurance", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3787-5fa86-3246-1.html", "question": "保險費應如何繳交？", "chunk_type": "long_split", "length_type": "long", "chunk_index": 2, "chunk_total": 3, "distance": 0.44262832403182983}, {"rank": 2, "doc_id": "insurance_006", "source": "insurance", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3788-08cff-3246-1.html", "question": "被保險人不按期繳納保險費，權益會受到什麼影響？", "chunk_type": "long_split", "length_type": "long", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 2, "distance": 0.4443838596343994}, {"rank": 3, "doc_id": "insurance_005", "source": "insurance", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3787-5fa86-3246-1.html", "question": "保險費應如何繳交？", "chunk_type": "long_split", "length_type": "long", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 3, "distance": 0.45758557319641113}], "table_matches": [{"rank": 1, "table_id": "premium_ratio", "title": "各類保險對象保險費的負擔比率", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3783-12823-3246-1.html", "source": "nhi", "score": 5.0, "matched_rows": [], "matched_fields": [], "general_rules": {}}, {"rank": 2, "table_id": "student_foreign_premium", "title": "在學僑生、外籍生應繳納多少保險費，如何繳納", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3791-61e1b-3246-1.html", "source": "nhi", "score": 5.0, "matched_rows": [], "matched_fields": [], "general_rules": {}}, {"rank": 3, "table_id": "premium_subsidy", "title": "各級政府辦理保險對象健保費補助項目一覽表", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3789-62c16-3246-1.html", "source": "nhi", "score": 3.5, "matched_rows": [], "matched_fields": [], "general_rules": {"auto_apply": ["左列多數補